From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] kernelbase: network drive errors in Windows' words

NET USE prints "System error N has occurred." and the system's message for
N (0982). For the network drive errors Wine's messages were its own short
ones: a server that is not there said "Bad network path.", a drive letter
in use "Already assigned.", a refusal "Access denied." (s14 regression
walk, 2026-10-06). People search for Windows' sentences, and programs show
them too. The messages for ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED, ERROR_BAD_NETPATH,
ERROR_BAD_NET_NAME, ERROR_ALREADY_ASSIGNED, ERROR_INVALID_PASSWORD,
ERROR_NO_NET_OR_BAD_PATH, ERROR_SESSION_CREDENTIAL_CONFLICT and
ERROR_NO_NETWORK now read as Windows' do.

Test: test/neterrtext-gate.sh with test/neterrtext-probe.c (FormatMessage
for each; the mutant -- this file's old texts -- fails it).
---
--- a/dlls/kernelbase/winerror.mc
+++ b/dlls/kernelbase/winerror.mc
@@ -48,7 +48,7 @@
 MessageId=5
 SymbolicName=ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED
 Language=ENU
-Access denied.
+Access is denied.
 .
 MessageId=6
 SymbolicName=ERROR_INVALID_HANDLE
@@ -228,7 +228,7 @@
 MessageId=53
 SymbolicName=ERROR_BAD_NETPATH
 Language=ENU
-Bad network path.
+The network path was not found.
 .
 MessageId=54
 SymbolicName=ERROR_NETWORK_BUSY
@@ -298,7 +298,7 @@
 MessageId=67
 SymbolicName=ERROR_BAD_NET_NAME
 Language=ENU
-Bad network name.
+The network name cannot be found.
 .
 MessageId=68
 SymbolicName=ERROR_TOO_MANY_NAMES
@@ -348,12 +348,12 @@
 MessageId=85
 SymbolicName=ERROR_ALREADY_ASSIGNED
 Language=ENU
-Already assigned.
+The local device name is already in use.
 .
 MessageId=86
 SymbolicName=ERROR_INVALID_PASSWORD
 Language=ENU
-Invalid password.
+The specified network password is not correct.
 .
 MessageId=87
 SymbolicName=ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER
@@ -1643,7 +1643,7 @@
 MessageId=1203
 SymbolicName=ERROR_NO_NET_OR_BAD_PATH
 Language=ENU
-No network or bad path.
+The network path was either typed incorrectly, does not exist, or the network provider is not currently available. Please try retyping the path or contact your network administrator.
 .
 MessageId=1204
 SymbolicName=ERROR_BAD_PROVIDER
@@ -1723,7 +1723,7 @@
 MessageId=1219
 SymbolicName=ERROR_SESSION_CREDENTIAL_CONFLICT
 Language=ENU
-Session credential conflict.
+Multiple connections to a server or shared resource by the same user, using more than one user name, are not allowed. Disconnect all previous connections to the server or shared resource and try again.
 .
 MessageId=1220
 SymbolicName=ERROR_REMOTE_SESSION_LIMIT_EXCEEDED
@@ -1738,7 +1738,7 @@
 MessageId=1222
 SymbolicName=ERROR_NO_NETWORK
 Language=ENU
-No network.
+The network is not present or not started.
 .
 MessageId=1223
 SymbolicName=ERROR_CANCELLED
